{"slug": "muller-en-co-n-v-rotterdam", "synopsis": "This silent 1928 company film shows Muller \\u0026 Co.'s shipping, cargo, and passenger operations in Rotterdam and London. Ships move through open water and busy harbors, including a vessel passing beneath London\u2019s Tower Bridge, while waterfront panoramas reveal quays, warehouses, cranes, and dense city streets. At the docks, workers unload moored ships, and two laborers pause to smile at the camera.\\\\n\\\\nPassenger traffic forms another major subject as people board and leave ships and a vessel crowded with travelers departs. Harbor machinery and construction also receive attention, with views of rail cars, cranes, steamships\u2014including the Caledonia\u2014and the exposed steel framework of a ship being built. Together, these scenes record the labor, transportation, and industrial facilities behind the company\u2019s port business.", "clips": [{"id": "9792ce93-0fba-54c1-95aa-61eb1b983e27", "sourceSlug": "muller-en-co-n-v-rotterdam", "sourceTitle": "Muller en co n.v. Rotterdam", "sourceYear": 1928, "position": 0, "startSeconds": 0.0, "endSeconds": 6.08, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/muller-en-co-n-v-rotterdam/clips/0000000000-0000006080.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/muller-en-co-n-v-rotterdam/thumbnails/0000000000-0000006080.jpg"}, {"id": "34c4b57c-3cea-5d8d-9f91-8229ffbde1ae", "sourceSlug": "muller-en-co-n-v-rotterdam", "sourceTitle": "Muller en co n.v. Rotterdam", "sourceYear": 1928, "position": 1, "startSeconds": 6.08, "endSeconds": 10.24, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/muller-en-co-n-v-rotterdam/clips/0000006080-0000010240.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/muller-en-co-n-v-rotterdam/thumbnails/0000006080-0000010240.jpg"}, {"id": "ad3e4632-7d1d-5ff5-afd3-4db689add0f2", "sourceSlug": "muller-en-co-n-v-rotterdam", "sou